class Splition3(System.Object):
    """Provides static methods for cutting 3D geometry into pieces.

    A curve is cut at a position along it or wherever a plane crosses it, and the pieces come back in order along
    the subject, so the first piece always holds its start point and the last holds its end point. A region or a
    body is cut by a plane and the pieces come back sorted by side.

